Chromium 158.0.8127.31 + the later changes of its release branch, up to
6e4734a70631ba26f68b5f866a8840041e407871 (refs/branch-heads/8127@{#1441}), for the
158.0.8127.31 tree that chromium-158.0.8127.18-to-158.0.8127.31.patch makes.

